  "description": "Nam Eun-ho, a college student living alone with his younger sister,\nhas lived a life of extreme misfortune, beginning with a childhood car accident.\nEun-ho's sole goal is to live an ordinary life, remaining unnoticed.\nThen, one day, a campus goddess, unexpectedly entangled with him, strikes him with a sudden urge!\nIs this a stroke of luck, or the start of yet another misfortune?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=848471), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13787605)",
